        "rationale": "The agent retrieved the correct asset/window data (4 complete samples for Transformer 1 at MAIN) but never completed the core anomaly screen on hydrogen, oxygen and nitrogen, so no flags were produced, no suspect/genuine labelling was done, and no decision branch was applied. It did not confirm the asset via iot.sites/iot.asset_ids, did not check iot.stream_extent, and did not run tsfm.data_quality. When find_models returned an empty catalog, it should have used the inline SubLOF estimator shown",
